# Notable messages under jimtcl
j19-proc-statics.tcl	L4	W210	Variable 'Callable { allocation: CallableStorageIdentity { site: CommandAllocationSite { s
j22-string-and-list-misc.tcl	L1	W001	Unknown subcommand 'byterange' for 'string'
j02-collect-finalize.tcl	L2	W214	Parameter 'r' of proc '::fin' is unused
j11-exists.tcl	L2	W211	Variable 'x' is set but never used
# j19 W210 is false (statics initialise count) and its message prints a Rust Debug value; j22 W001 is false (Jim has string byterange);
# j02 W214 is false (finalizer has a fixed signature); j11 W211 is arguable ('exists x' observes x).
# False negatives under tcl9.0: j06 $d(a) on a scalar (tclsh: variable isn't array), j16 dict get on an array, j15 brace backslash-newline difference.
